OL,5,G1200 Earlier... with Jools Holland
OL,6,     FJools is joined by the historian,
OL,7,     Fauthor and TV presenter Dan Jones.
OL,8,G1300 Key Changes: Radio 3's...
OL,9,     F...Essential History of Classical
OL,10,     FMusic. 1853, Dusseldorf. A young
OL,11,     FJohannes Brahms visits the home of
OL,12,     FRobert and Clara Schumann.
OL,13,G1400 Record Review
OL,14,     FAndrew McGregor with a thorough
OL,15,     Flook at the week's classical music
OL,16,     Freleases, plus news and
OL,17,     Frecommendations.
