OL,5,G1600 Sound of Cinema
OL,6,     FEdith Bowman showcases the very
OL,7,     Fbest in screen music. In this
OL,8,     Fweek's special edition, she'll
OL,9,     Ftake a deeper dive into the
OL,10,     F'songwriters of the silver
OL,11,     Fscreen.'.
OL,12,G1700 This Classical Life
OL,13,     FJess Gillam is joined by the
OL,14,     FScottish jazz pianist and composer
OL,15,     FFergus McCreadie for a listening
OL,16,     Fparty, featuring music by Brahms,
OL,17,     FSaariaho and Scott Walker.
